{"id":"1fc2fdfc6caa6be0","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-rowbottom.md","title":"Rowbottom Cardinal","display":"df-rowbottom — Rowbottom Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-rowbottom","aliases":["58-df-rowbottom"],"display":"df-rowbottom — Rowbottom Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-rowbottom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-rowbottom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rowbottom — Rowbottom Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md\">../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rowbottom}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Rowbottom}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (Rowbottom-cardinal predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset.md\">58-df-finite-subset.md</a> 的有限子集记号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 及序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\">\\([A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\prime\\prime}B\\coloneqq f[B]\">\\(f^{\\prime\\prime}B\\coloneqq f[B]\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)\">\\(B\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\)</span>；函数集与像使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function.md\">58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rowbottom} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rowbottom}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\in\\lambda^{[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega}}\\;\\exists H\\in[\\kappa]^\\kappa\\;\\bigl(|f^{\\prime\\prime}[H]^{&lt;\\omega}|\\leq\\omega\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rowbottom} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rowbottom}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\in\\lambda^{[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega}}\\;\\exists H\\in[\\kappa]^\\kappa\\;\\bigl(|f^{\\prime\\prime}[H]^{&lt;\\omega}|\\leq\\omega\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Rowbottom cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> has the property that any coloring of finite subsets into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> many colors has a subset of size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> on which only countably many colors occur.</li>\n<li>Rowbottom cardinals are large cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa\\in V$ (cardinal parameter, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，采用 [[58-df-finite-subset.md]] 的有限子集记号。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f^{\\prime\\prime}B\\coloneqq f[B]$，其中 $f$ 为函数且 $B\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)$；函数集与像使用 [[58-df-function.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rowbottom}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f^{\\prime\\prime}B\\coloneqq f[B]","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rowbottom} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rowbottom}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\in\\lambda^{[\\kappa]^{<\\omega}}\\;\\exists H\\in[\\kappa]^\\kappa\\;\\bigl(|f^{\\prime\\prime}[H]^{<\\omega}|\\leq\\omega\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1611,"backlinks":[{"id":"02b6daaefe3c5275","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rowbottom}_S(\\kappa)$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-rowbottom.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rowbottom.md|58-df-rowbottom]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590","130f2eb9510d97cd","36d7463d215be751"]}